# Documentation and Handoff

Every final task report must contain:

- Branch name
- Commit hashes and subjects
- Files changed
- Schema/migration changes (or explicit "none")
- API contract changes (or explicit "none")
- Tests added and updated
- Test-file and test totals after the change
- Lint, typecheck, and build results
- CI result for the branch
- Database-safety confirmation (`dev.db` untouched; disposable DBs cleaned)
- Secret-scan result (no credentials in diff)
- Deferred work and follow-ups
- Main hash after merge, when available

When a completed task changes project state (contracts, phases, counts), update
`docs/ai/CURRENT_STATE.md` in the same branch. Use `docs/ai/TASK_HANDOFF_TEMPLATE.md`
for new task briefs.
